{"id": "28152", "revid": "36420", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=28152", "title": "Porterville", "text": "Porterville is a city in Tulare County in California's San Joaquin Valley.\nGet in.\nPorterville is located 19 miles (30 km) east of California SR-99 via Ave 44 (CA SR-190).\nGet around.\nCars are by far the best way to get around. Public transport has buses that run once every 40 minutes. Routes are on Porterville city website. In addition they have vehicles formerly run by the city, now part of Uber. Fare is $3, twice city bus fare, and carry one fare at a time so there will be delays, and require smart phones.\nEat.\nHabi Sushi 920 W Henderson \n559-789-0800 Sushi and Japanese food \nStafford's Chocolates 114 N. Main 559-784-6640 Chocolate candies and truffles made in the store. Also offers pastries, coffees and other beverages."}
